======================  DEAD END  ======================

You stride confidently through the open door...

...straight into a wall of cold stone. CLANG!

This was a DEAD END -- the trap's stone jaws, closing behind you.

You followed the obvious path, and the obvious path was BAIT.

But breathe easy: it is only the dungeon toying with you.

NOTHING real was harmed. No file of yours was deleted or moved.

  >> Retreat:   « cd .. »

The true way out of the trap room is HIDDEN, not gaping open.

Go back, brighten your torch with « ls -a », and find what the

careless never see. LOOK before you LEAP.
